{"data":[{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T10:40:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119017100824154611"],"id":"2119017100824154611","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":148,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"做兄弟在心中！！！！！ https://t.co/W9E1nuVWQ0","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2119017100824154611"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T10:22:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119012601925656733"],"id":"2119012601925656733","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":65,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想和我一样，通过 X 创作获得收入吗？\n\n其实没你想的那么复杂。\n\n不需要露脸，不需要拍视频，也不需要什么专业设备。\n\n你只需要准备好素材，学会用 AI批图就行 https://t.co/zMAuM6ebI0","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2119012601925656733"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T09:34:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119000488591155474"],"id":"2119000488591155474","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":267,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"认识一个顶美富婆，住在深圳纯水岸，40岁了，保养的和20几岁小姑娘一样，以前在南油搞女士服装发家的，\n\n她说她早期一件连衣裙爆款品就赚了300多万纯利润，她在30岁的时候就和前夫离婚了，孩子跟着她，这些年也换了很多男朋友，","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2119000488591155474"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T09:03:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118992634190668280"],"id":"2118992634190668280","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":207,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"只有高智商的人才能解开这个问题 https://t.co/ph6uxxt9XI","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118992634190668280"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T08:29:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118984050283368512"],"id":"2118984050283368512","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":175,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不懂就问\n\n左边这个人\n\n还能见到明天的太阳吗？ https://t.co/MlrZQw7E9u","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118984050283368512"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T08:24:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118982812191912437"],"id":"2118982812191912437","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":80,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"7天不到300w的浏览量，这算什么水平啊\n\n有兄弟说一下吗？ https://t.co/A1v2D90eTo","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118982812191912437"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T07:43:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118972675322519622"],"id":"2118972675322519622","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":439,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"潘金莲的胆子到底有多大？西门庆刚走，她就破了西门庆定的规矩\n\n西门庆是日头偏西才走的。临走前把家里大小事务都交代了一遍，又把潘金莲叫到跟前，说：“我此去东京，少则半月，多则一月。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118972675322519622"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:42:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118957218905432215"],"id":"2118957218905432215","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":403,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中年女生喜欢被撩吗？大学同学她妈，大二的时候来校看她，穿的某单位制服，和我同学迎面向我走来时真的英姿飒爽，齐耳的短发利利落落，肩背挺得笔直，制服衬得她眉眼都带着股干练劲儿，一眼撞进我眼里，愣是让我站在原地忘了挪脚。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118957218905432215"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T05:48:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118943676592513266"],"id":"2118943676592513266","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1300,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这张截图绝对是今天硅谷最炸裂的瓜。63岁的AI教父黄仁勋，硬生生被演成了一出色戒。\n\n美国政府咬定这个叫Alice Huang的华裔美女高管是间谍，借着谈恋爱的名义窃取英伟达的算力机密。纽约时报连两人在台北酒吧碰面的细节都扒出来了，甚至惊动了特朗普听简报。 https://t.co/r5OIr3ln6z","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118943676592513266"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T05:18:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118936143802794165"],"id":"2118936143802794165","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":369,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我前任出轨聊骚时就这样 https://t.co/llsiZuP8dQ","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118936143802794165"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T04:39:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118926380205580721"],"id":"2118926380205580721","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2279,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一男一女合租一套房。某天夜里，女人去洗澡，男人趁机走进她的卧室，拿起她的衣服，一件一件地闻着。\n\n我在外打工，和一个男人合租过，我知道那种日子，两个人住一个屋檐下，抬头不见低头见，最怕的就是界限不清。\n\n这事发生在我表弟身上。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118926380205580721"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T03:28:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118908545836142609"],"id":"2118908545836142609","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":42549,"like_count":45,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"上午去药房买药，看到有个女生在买伟哥，一点也不害臊，我就问她，为什么不是你老公自己来买，让你一个女孩来。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118908545836142609"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T02:32:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118894243871850601"],"id":"2118894243871850601","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":221,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"2026年的十大酷刑 https://t.co/wdj6hbLfu8","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118894243871850601"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T00:52:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118869127096119662"],"id":"2118869127096119662","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":241,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"清朝北京有种店，叫\"鸡毛房\"。\n三文钱一晚。进去要把衣服脱光，钻进一堆鸡毛里，只露个头。\n不是老板变态。鸡毛得贴着肉才暖，穿着衣服钻，等于白花钱。\n三文钱是什么概念？当时北京城里，一碗面就是这个价。\n也就是说，一个无处可去的人，用一整晚的全部预算，买了一个\"不会冻死\"。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118869127096119662"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-07T00:10:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118858706175869276"],"id":"2118858706175869276","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":190,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"人类是有弱点的，贪婪、恐惧、侥幸，而机器只有纪律。在这个吃人的市场里，手工单早就该绝种了。\n\n承认自己管不住手，不丢人。还在死磕手工单的，评论区报个数，让我看看有多少头铁娃。 https://t.co/aheRrQY3jS","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118858706175869276"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T23:27:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118847799953654049"],"id":"2118847799953654049","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8589,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大伟相亲回来，进门灌了半瓶冰红茶，跟我说：“哥，现在女的太猛了。”\n我说咋了。女方说了句“我先跟你坦白个事”，然后手就往领口去了，刷刷解开两颗扣子，锁骨底下露出一行小字纹身，说：“我胸口有纹身，你能接受吗？","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118847799953654049"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T17:14:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118753975017300029"],"id":"2118753975017300029","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1575,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"晚上十点半，临江那家叫“沐光”的足疗店还亮着灯。\n\n门口的霓虹招牌有点接触不良，一闪一闪的，像喘不上气。穿西装的男人推开玻璃门，带着一身酒气和烟味，往沙发上一瘫，哑着嗓子喊：“来个技师，使劲儿的。”","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118753975017300029"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T16:19:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118740177124475075"],"id":"2118740177124475075","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":502,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"延安大学那个54岁的钢琴副教授投湖的事，绝对是今年最让人后背发凉的黑色幽默。\n\n我一个在高校当青椒的哥们跟我说起这事，抽了半包烟，最后只憋出一句：这就是把体面人往死里逼的下场。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118740177124475075"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T14:56:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118719283354374270"],"id":"2118719283354374270","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":684,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这是个真实的事情，信不信由你。村里有一户人家，连生了五个女儿，不见男孩。\n为了生个男孩，这家男人，竟想出了这个法子：借种。\n老是生女孩，男人急了，一心想要个男孩。男人怀疑问题出在自己身上，是自己下的种不行。\n\n就跟媳妇儿商量，要不换个法子，借个种。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118719283354374270"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T14:18:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118709729786818700"],"id":"2118709729786818700","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":60463,"like_count":67,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"老婆出轨后我去找那野男人的妻子，谁料她开门放我进屋，随手扣上门小声说：别急着撕破脸，\n我瞬间僵在门口，满腔怒火直接卡住，原本准备好的所有控诉、狠话、证据，一下都没用上。","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118709729786818700"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T13:27:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118696779487346905"],"id":"2118696779487346905","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":407,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"看完这个爆料，真替这哥们憋屈得慌\n三周年纪念日加上女友生日，哥们满心欢喜出去挑礼物。结果人家不仅给他备了一份史诗级的绿帽大礼包，还在跟他吃生日饭的间隙，抽空给那个知三当三的老板发消息说很想他！ https://t.co/8mDLYjHHnR","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118696779487346905"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T12:38:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118684566273855800"],"id":"2118684566273855800","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2008,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"20年前，陈乔恩在台湾综艺上，被逼着当众脱掉了内衣。\n\n游戏输了，男嘉宾起哄，她喊着我不要脱，可还是脱了。\n\n内衣被人拿在手里吐槽太老，她裹着浴巾站在那里，满脸通红。\n\n20年前被逼当众脱内衣，那时候她的人生，根本自己说了不算","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118684566273855800"},{"author_id":"3097944448","created_at":"2026-11-06T11:44:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2118670814560272665"],"id":"2118670814560272665","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":450,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"兄弟们，昨晚去洗个脚，差点被套路得底裤都不剩，今天必须给大伙排个雷。 https://t.co/fH88KURme4","url":"https://x.com/Hy9788/status/2118670814560272665"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"3097944448","name":"浪子燕青","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2095719838446665730/8QFP8Ev8_normal.jpg","username":"Hy9788","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2119017100824154611","oldest_id":"2118670814560272665","result_count":23}}
